# Dinotomaton: "Menace. When this creature enters, target creature you control gains menace until end of turn." Turn 1 Bot1 casts an
# Ornithopter and then Dinotomaton (Black Lotus + Mox Ruby): the trigger targets the Ornithopter, which gains menace (CR 702.110a, 611.2a)
# while Dinotomaton keeps its own printed menace. On turn 3 the Ornithopter has lost it again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Dinotomaton
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dinotomaton.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Menace
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dinotomaton.Keywords = Menace
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dinotomaton.Keywords = Menace
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
